Publishes a map update when the terrain load mode changes, as the tile LOD
setters do, so a continuous map renders with the new mesh-tile cap and build
budgets without waiting for another change. Setting the mode it already has
publishes nothing.
Upstream: not proposed

diff --git a/src/mln/map/map.cpp b/src/mln/map/map.cpp
